Separately run programs
-----------------------
TrustPCB runs the following programs as separate processes. It does not import, link
to, or redistribute them, and their licences do not apply to TrustPCB's own code.

  KiCad (kicad-cli)  GNU General Public License v3.0 or later    https://www.kicad.org/
  openEMS            GNU General Public License v3.0             https://www.openems.de/
  Chrome or Chromium (optional, used only to print report PDFs; not included)

Anyone who builds or distributes the openEMS Docker image (docker/ems) is responsible for
meeting the GPL terms for that image. The image is built from source at a pinned openEMS
release on a Debian base and also contains Debian packages that keep their own licences.

